msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mv-hilfe.php:188
msgid "Annual figures per bank certificate (interest, repayment, balance). Take precedence over calculated values."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mv-hilfe.php:194
msgid "Annual report per property: income, expenses by Anlage V line, depreciation, loan interest, prior-year comparison. CSV export; line mapping adjustable."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mv-hilfe.php:200
msgid "Matching rules for the bank import: search term or IBAN → tenancy or cost type."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mv-hilfe.php:206
msgid "Anonymise ended tenancies after the retention periods expire, export access reports under Art. 15 GDPR. Overview of deletion concept and deadlines."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mv-hilfe.php:212
msgid "Creates landlord, property, units (flat + garage), tenant and tenancy with rent conditions in five steps. Each step saves immediately; the wizard can be reopened at any time to complete the entries."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mv-hilfe.php:218
msgid "Landlord details, bank account, creditor ID, tax number, dunning and portal options. Backup of all plugin tables as JSON, restore, option “delete data on uninstall”."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mv-hilfe.php:224
msgid "Insert the shortcode [mietfux_portal] on a page. Logged-in tenants (linked WordPress user) see statements and released documents, and report damage and meter readings."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mv-hilfe.php:225
msgid "Portal access in one click: “Invite to portal” on the overview card (or the envelope icon in the tenancy list) creates the WordPress user from the tenant’s e-mail address, links it and e-mails a link to set a password plus the portal address. “Portal preview” shows you the portal exactly as that tenant sees it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mv-hilfe.php:234
msgid "Rental management for private landlords: master data, payments, receipts, service charge statements, tax (Anlage V), tenancy agreement and tenant portal in one plugin. On every page you will find a short description under “Help” at the top right."
msgstr ""

